.TH "MANPAGER-NVIMPAGER" "1" "November 2026" "arran4/dotfiles" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
manpager\-nvimpager \- render man output through nvimpager
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
\fBmanpager\-nvimpager\fR
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Filter standard input through col \-bx, then pass the result to nvimpager \-. Intended as a MANPAGER helper in the shell environment.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
\fBMANPAGER\fR
May be set to this helper by chezmoi\-generated shell configuration.
.SH SEE ALSO
man(1)
